      "text": "How to use: press Play on “1 · Today”. The left menu moves between screens. Working controls: reviewer and type filters, approve / request changes and reassigning reviewers; the transactions list (filter, open any of 11 files, switch files) with per-file tabs and deadline confirmation; pipeline filter, lead assignment, the role-permission matrix and invite form, and the hourly-cost tweak on Economics.\n\nDesigned for one designated broker today, with associate brokers, supervised salespersons and an unlicensed coordinator ready to add later. All people, properties and figures are sample data."
